-- s 41(1): before the notice is laid, always; after it is laid on 3 March, notice of the resolution within the 15 sitting days after, to 18 March
#ASSERT `s 41(1) either House may pass a resolution disallowing the statutory rule` `sample days the House sat` NOTHING (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
